B.avG=new A.U("Meet day roles","# Meet day roles\n\n- **Drive coach**: plans each match with the alliance partner and calls the play.\n- **Drivers**: practise together before the meet; same two people all day if you can.\n- **Pit crew**: batteries, repairs, and the robot ready 10 minutes before each match.\n- **Scouts**: scout every match in the Scouting tab, in pairs so nobody misses a match.\n- **Judging**: who presents to the judges, and who knows each part of the robot.\n\nEdit this page with your own names.")
B.avL=new A.U("Battery care","# Battery care\n\n1. Label every battery and add it to **Batteries**.\n2. Charge with the charger made for it, and log it as charged.\n3. Check the voltage before each match and log it.\n4. A battery that's damaged, swollen or hot goes out of use: mark it retired.\n5. Never leave batteries charging unattended.")
B.aw1=new A.U("Writing a log entry","# Writing a log entry\n\nWrite one after every meeting where something changed:\n\n- **What we did**, and why.\n- **What happened**: test results, numbers, what broke.\n- **What's next.**\n\nAdd photos, and tag the awards it backs up (Think, Design, Control...). The Portfolio builder sorts them.")
B.awr=new A.U("Shop safety","# Shop safety\n\n- Safety glasses on whenever tools or the robot are running.\n- Tie back long hair; no loose sleeves near moving parts.\n- Turn the robot off before working on it.\n- Put tools back; clean up at the end of every meeting.\n- Tell a mentor about any injury, however small.")
